"When the Apple TV is on and has a network, the tunnel comes up by itself — no need to open this app first. STOP does not turn this off: it only stops the tunnel until the next Connect, which arms it again." = "Apple TV 开机并联网后，隧道会自行接管，不必先打开这个 App。按 STOP 不会关掉它：只停到下一次按「连接」，那时它重新生效。";
"Whether the packet tunnel is up. Everything else on this screen is read from it while it runs." = "数据包隧道是否在运行。本屏其他内容都是在它运行时从它读出来的。";
"Which copy of the GeoIP and GeoSite databases the tunnel is using." = "隧道正在使用哪一份 GeoIP 与 GeoSite 数据库。";
"Which copy of the GeoIP and GeoSite databases the tunnel loaded." = "隧道加载了哪一份 GeoIP 与 GeoSite 数据库。";
"download failed: %@" = "下载失败：%@";
"tvOS guarantees 500 KB of storage and may discard the rest. A link survives that; a file does not." = "tvOS 只保证 500 KB 的存储空间，其余随时可能被清掉。链接能挺过去；文件不能。";
